{"4290910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "X Space", "steam_appid": 4290910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/899fcd0d0973ee8e778bef89f234c2a3.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to survive and find answers. In <i>X SPACE</i>, you must step personally into the unforgiving void. Scavenge wreckage to piece together your first life-support system and establish automated production lines to secure a steady supply of resources. Snap massive space station modules seamlessly together and arm your base to repel warping enemy forces. This is not just a static shelter; it is your mobile fortress in deep space. In the freezing silence of the universe, your engineering blueprints and tactical decisions are the only line between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/732e52aa74473f9a8c378179222da780.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/732e52aa74473f9a8c378179222da780.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Freedom Modular Building:</strong> Start with a single, isolated core module and use a deep building system to design and expand your space fortress. Dispatch a network of logistics drones to create highly efficient, automated resource transportation and production lines. Use precise node-snapping to ensure airtight airlocks, freely crafting your very own steel behemoth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/d78a502653be11992c4c6f8dae4141c6.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/d78a502653be11992c4c6f8dae4141c6.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Community Blueprints:</strong> Break the boundaries of imagination! Visit the official game website to download creative, bizarre, and wildly unique space base templates designed by the global player community. Import these blueprints with a single click to expand your interstellar hub on the shoulders of giants, or share your own ultimate fortress to become a legendary engineer revered across the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/a58243203782383e14e773d8b1ec8716.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/a58243203782383e14e773d8b1ec8716.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Role Fleet &amp; 3D Defense:</strong> Deep space is never peaceful. Deploy a network of anti-air turrets around your base to defend against hull-shattering meteor storms and enemies lurking in the dark. Build and command a versatile fleet: dispatch warships to scout unknown sectors, mine rare resources in high-risk areas, or engage in intense, physics-driven 3D dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/cc0182af01f5f9b7447aed009e4ad5bd.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot Your Star Fortress &amp; Explore:</strong> Your base is not a dead construct. Drive this massive mobile mothership across the vast universe. Navigate through dangerous sectors, explore abandoned ruins, and scavenge rare resources and lost technology blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/4f28edd9540f53ee7f500615505edca7.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Survival &amp; Seeking the Truth:</strong> As the last spark of humanity, balancing complex life-support loops is your top priority. Manage oxygen and power in extreme environments, and perform high-risk spacewalks for resource extraction. As your journey progresses, piece together clues to finally unravel the shocking mystery behind the destruction of your mothership.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/899fcd0d0973ee8e778bef89f234c2a3.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to survive and find answers. In <i>X SPACE</i>, you must step personally into the unforgiving void. Scavenge wreckage to piece together your first life-support system and establish automated production lines to secure a steady supply of resources. Snap massive space station modules seamlessly together and arm your base to repel warping enemy forces. This is not just a static shelter; it is your mobile fortress in deep space. In the freezing silence of the universe, your engineering blueprints and tactical decisions are the only line between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/732e52aa74473f9a8c378179222da780.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/732e52aa74473f9a8c378179222da780.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Freedom Modular Building:</strong> Start with a single, isolated core module and use a deep building system to design and expand your space fortress. Dispatch a network of logistics drones to create highly efficient, automated resource transportation and production lines. Use precise node-snapping to ensure airtight airlocks, freely crafting your very own steel behemoth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/d78a502653be11992c4c6f8dae4141c6.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/d78a502653be11992c4c6f8dae4141c6.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Community Blueprints:</strong> Break the boundaries of imagination! Visit the official game website to download creative, bizarre, and wildly unique space base templates designed by the global player community. Import these blueprints with a single click to expand your interstellar hub on the shoulders of giants, or share your own ultimate fortress to become a legendary engineer revered across the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/a58243203782383e14e773d8b1ec8716.avif?t=1777107635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras_big/a58243203782383e14e773d8b1ec8716.avif?t=1777107635 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Role Fleet &amp; 3D Defense:</strong> Deep space is never peaceful. Deploy a network of anti-air turrets around your base to defend against hull-shattering meteor storms and enemies lurking in the dark. Build and command a versatile fleet: dispatch warships to scout unknown sectors, mine rare resources in high-risk areas, or engage in intense, physics-driven 3D dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/cc0182af01f5f9b7447aed009e4ad5bd.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot Your Star Fortress &amp; Explore:</strong> Your base is not a dead construct. Drive this massive mobile mothership across the vast universe. Navigate through dangerous sectors, explore abandoned ruins, and scavenge rare resources and lost technology blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290910/extras/4f28edd9540f53ee7f500615505edca7.avif?t=1777107635\" width=1560 height=974 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Survival &amp; Seeking the Truth:</strong> As the last spark of humanity, balancing complex life-support loops is your top priority. Manage oxygen and power in extreme environments, and perform high-risk spacewalks for resource extraction. As your journey progresses, piece together clues to finally unravel the shocking mystery behind the destruction of your mothership.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A sudden, devastating strike has reduced your interstellar voyage to ruins. As the sole survivor in X SPACE, you must rebuild your space base from scratch, assemble a versatile fleet, and pilot your massive mobile fortress into the depths of the universe.", "supported_languages": "E